          "reviewedOn": "2026-07-22",
          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures Rambox's config.json (workspace layout, app list, UI/theme preferences) from %APPDATA%\\Rambox. All Chromium browser state (Local Storage, Cookies, Session Storage) is excluded — it holds per-service auth tokens and is not portable. Confidence: medium — config.json path inferred from standard Electron userData layout and community reports; exact schema may vary between Rambox CE and Pro editions. Authored secret warning: Rambox's Chromium Local Storage and Cookies contain per-service session tokens and auth credentials for all integrated messaging apps (Slack, Gmail, WhatsApp, etc.). These MUST NOT be auto-restored — re-authenticate each service after restore. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %APPDATA%\\Rambox\\Local Storage, %APPDATA%\\Rambox\\Session Storage, %APPDATA%\\Rambox\\Cookies, %APPDATA%\\Rambox\\Network"
        }
